<title>POLAND: POLISH ELPO SEES 1997 NET SOARING TO PLN 2.1 MLN.</title>
<headline>POLISH ELPO SEES 1997 NET SOARING TO PLN 2.1 MLN.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1997-02-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>Polish garment maker Elpo SA sees its 1997 net profit rising to 2.1 million zlotys, up from last year's 1.3 million, the company said in a statement on Thursday.</p>
<p>Elpo said its sales were likely to grow to 20.5 million zlotys, up from 15 million zlotys in 1996.</p>
<p>Elpo will be the first firm listed on the free market of the Warsaw bourse, but no date of the debut has yet been announced.</p>
<p>-- Warsaw Newsroom +48 22 653 9700</p>
